# Problems Practiced

## ✅ Problem 1 – Create and Print a Set

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30,40,50}
print(a)
```

---

## ✅ Problem 2 – Print All Elements

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30,40,50}

for i in a:
    print(i)
```

---

## ✅ Problem 3 – Find Length of a Set

### Code

```python
