## ✅ Problem 6 – Search an Element

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30,40}

key = 30

if key in a:
    print("Found")
else:
    print("Not Found")
```

---

## ✅ Problem 7 – Remove Duplicates Using Set

### Code

```python
a = [10,20,20,30,40,40,50]

b = set(a)

print(b)
```

---

## ✅ Problem 8 – Count Unique Elements

### Code

```python
a = [10,20,20,30,40,40,50]

b = set(a)

print(len(b))
```

---

## ✅ Problem 9 – Find Common Elements

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30,40}
b = {30,40,50,60}

for i in a:
    for j in b:
        if i == j:
            print(j)
```

---

## ✅ Problem 10 – Union of Two Sets

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30}
b = {30,40,50}

print(a.union(b))
```

